WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.067
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:03.067
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:04.067
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:05.067
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:06.601
Secretary of State Tony Blinken

00:00:06.601 --> 00:00:09.601
testified today before the
Senate Foreign Affairs Committee

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:11.701
about the U.S. withdrawal
from Afghanistan,

00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:14.767
but not before trying
every other topic first.

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:16.334
"Okay, before we get to that,

00:00:16.334 --> 00:00:19.100
who wants to hear what is
in Area 51?"

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.234
[ Laughter ]
After former President
George W. Bush appeared

00:00:22.234 --> 00:00:24.834
to compare Capitol rioters
to foreign terrorists,

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:28.067
in a speech commemorating
the September 11th attacks,

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:30.467
former President Trump
said yesterday that Bush

00:00:30.467 --> 00:00:32.167
"shouldn't be
lecturing anybody."

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:34.767
And I never thought
I'd say this sentence, but,

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:36.767
Bush, Trump,

00:00:36.767 --> 00:00:38.133
you're both right.

00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:40.901
[ Laughter ]
The U.S. will host
a virtual summit

00:00:40.901 --> 00:00:42.634
with global leaders next week,
called

00:00:42.634 --> 00:00:46.968
"Global COVID-19 Summit:
Ending the Pandemic
and Building Back Better."

00:00:46.968 --> 00:00:49.701
In related news,
the Mets are hosting a seminar

00:00:49.701 --> 00:00:51.334
at the Hyatt Regency, called

00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:52.934
"How to Win the World Series."

00:00:52.934 --> 00:00:54.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.501 --> 00:00:57.667
Russian President Vladimir Putin
is reportedly self-isolating

00:00:57.667 --> 00:00:59.734
after several members
of his entourage

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:02.267
tested positive
for the coronavirus.

00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:04.601
And they must have
some new variant over there

00:01:04.601 --> 00:01:06.434
because one of the symptoms is

00:01:06.434 --> 00:01:08.100
falling off a balcony.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.367 --> 00:01:13.701
A group of Senate Democrats
introduced

00:01:13.701 --> 00:01:15.834
new voting rights
legislation today

00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:18.167
which would make Election Day
a public holiday

00:01:18.167 --> 00:01:20.300
and require same-day
voter registration,

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:23.300
while Senate Republicans
introduced legislations

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:25.601
that you have to have
six forms of ID,

00:01:25.601 --> 00:01:28.200
be able to beat the underwater
levels in "Mario,"

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.167
and reunuite Oasis.

00:01:30.167 --> 00:01:32.133
[ Laughter ]
That's right, Senate Democrats

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:33.734
introduced a new
voting rights bill

00:01:33.734 --> 00:01:35.834
which would make Election Day
a public holiday.

00:01:35.834 --> 00:01:37.834
But not for you, Kornacki!

00:01:37.834 --> 00:01:39.467
24 straight hours on your feet.

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:42.601
No bathroom breaks for Kornacki!

00:01:42.601 --> 00:01:43.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.934 --> 00:01:46.801
House Democrats yesterday
proposed now tax increases

00:01:46.801 --> 00:01:48.834
on corporations,
the wealthy, investors,

00:01:48.834 --> 00:01:50.567
and high-income business owners.

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:51.901
And this is weird --
they announced it

00:01:51.901 --> 00:01:53.400
on AOC's dress.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.300
[ Laughter ]
After she announced

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.968
that she has not received
the coronavirus vaccine,

00:01:57.968 --> 00:02:00.267
rapper Nicki Minaj
tweeted yesterday

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:02.901
that a friend of her cousin
received the shot

00:02:02.901 --> 00:02:04.267
"&amp; became impotent"

00:02:04.267 --> 00:02:06.634
after "His testicles
became swollen."

00:02:06.634 --> 00:02:08.167
Which is pretty shocking
because,

00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:10.067
when I got the shot,

00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:11.467
it was in my arm.

00:02:11.467 --> 00:02:14.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:16.834
A new study suggests that cows

00:02:16.834 --> 00:02:19.734
can be potty-trained
as easily as toddlers.

00:02:19.734 --> 00:02:21.434
"Then I know
what the problem is,"

00:02:21.434 --> 00:02:22.767
said your plumber.

00:02:22.767 --> 00:02:27.267
[ Laughter ]
"It's, uh,

00:02:27.267 --> 00:02:28.334
it's cow [bleep]."

00:02:28.334 --> 00:02:30.300
[ Laughter ]

